<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CP Clare estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CP Clare estimates cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut its 1997 earnings per share estimate for CP Clare Corp by $0.23, to $0.89, and cut its 1998 estimate by $0.30, to $1.14.</p>
<p>-- Cowen said it kept its buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- stock was down 1/2 at 10.</p>
</text>
